/worked-solution" "value" "First, we organize the system so that it’s in the correct order and  both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}0x+y=-3 \\\\ x+0y=3\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13994130/state.json" "file_sha256" "1cf2d7cff521a3af2b075976fb8fe8e0cb1fa5b3ecaca0d07086eea6a36a616a"} {"question" "q-130514" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13994130/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "da2609ed45aa31cb1d9766990d31695403480cac39b14c0e2dbfd6af4687a711"} {"question" "q-130514" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13994130/state.json" "file_sha256" "1cf2d7cff521a3af2b075976fb8fe8e0cb1fa5b3ecaca0d07086eea6a36a616a"} {"question" "q-130514" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 0 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ -1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]"] ["math" "[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13994130/state.json" "file_sha256" "1cf2d7cff521a3af2b075976fb8fe8e0cb1fa5b3ecaca0d07086eea6a36a616a"} {"question" "q-130514" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "[\\begin{aligned}0 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}]"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13994130/state.json" "file_sha256" "1cf2d7cff521a3af2b075976fb8fe8e0cb1fa5b3ecaca0d07086eea6a36a616a"} {"question" "q-317521" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "For the following system of equations\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2x+5=y \\\\ 3x-2y=7,\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nits representation using matrices is\n\n| |  | {{field-1}} | $-1$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  | |  |  |  | |  | $x$ |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $y$ |  | | $=$ | |  | {{field-4}} |  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  | $7$ |  | |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  | {{field-1}} | $-1$ |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-2}} | {{field-3}} |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $x$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $y$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | {{field-4}} |  |  |  |  |  |\n|  | $7$ |  |  |  |  |  |\n\n." "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13994130/state.json" "file_sha256" "1cf2d7cff521a3af2b075976fb8fe8e0cb1fa5b3ecaca0d07086eea6a36a616a"} {"question" "q-317521" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "First, we organize the system so that it is in the correct order and  both $x$ and $y$ appear in each equation:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}2x-y=-5 \\\\ 3x-2y=7\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & -2\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-5 \\\\ 7\\end{aligned}].\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13994130/state.json" "file_sha256" "1cf2d7cff521a3af2b075976fb8fe8e0cb1fa5b3ecaca0d07086eea6a36a616a"} {"question" "q-317521" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/moderate "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13994130/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "da2609ed45aa31cb1d9766990d31695403480cac39b14c0e2dbfd6af4687a711"} {"question" "q-317521" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/blank "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13994130/state.json" "file_sha256" "1cf2d7cff521a3af2b075976fb8fe8e0cb1fa5b3ecaca0d07086eea6a36a616a"} {"question" "q-317521" "field" "field-1" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2"] "category" "model_interpretation" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/13994130/state.json" "file_sha256" "1cf2d7cff521a3af2b075976fb8fe8e0cb1fa5b3ecaca0d07086eea6a36a61